  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/59DEFA">Fact <span data-tag="59DEFA">6.4.4.1</span>.</a> The functor $\theta $ induces an isomorphism of partially ordered sets </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \Sub (Y \amalg _{X} Z) \rightarrow \Sub (Y) \times _{ \Sub (X) } \Sub (Z) \]
</div>
  <p> where $\Sub (M)$ denotes the partially ordered set of subsets of $M$. </p>
